{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"863631111585660938","content":"So I wrongfully assumed that I could add infusions to my arcane armor. Apparently there's so debate on that. Infusions are normally for nonmagical items, which my armor at one point was. But I turned it into arcane armor. There's a level 9 ability that allows you to treat the armor as multiple pieces to infuse so I guess the question is, is that the only way to infuse the armor at all or could I do it while the armor isn't magical?","created_at":"2021-07-28T18:39:22.345000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870012576732422145","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
